# GMS gives it 20 levels at 125+3x with 3 attacks; here it is the same climb in
# half the levels, ending where GMS ends.
#
# The only attack in this book, so it has no cooldown: a cooldown is for
# alternating a pair, as the other two magicians do, and there is no pair here.
# It is also GMS's slowest 2nd job magician animation and hits the fewest
# enemies, which is the Cleric's price for Blessed Ensemble.
name: "Holy Arrow"
description: "Attack multiple monsters with Holy Arrows."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_HOLY
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CLERIC skill_order: 1 }
max_level: 10
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 870
max_enemies: 4
lines: 3
base { skill_pct: 1.31 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.06 }
